REM CHWORDS: marks the chapter at the cursor as the block and shows its
REM word count. The chapter runs from its .lh 54pt line to the .pa line
REM of the next chapter, or to the end of the document.
Sub MAIN
AutoRestore(ON)
HideDots(OFF)
Key("^QD^QF.lh 54pt{Enter}")
Key("B{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}")
Stop
End IfException
Key("^KB^QF.pa^N{Enter}")
Key("{Enter}")
IfException
ACK: Key("{Enter}^QC^KK^K?")
Stop
End IfException
Key("^KK^K?")
End Sub
